<title>BELGIUM: EU to ask Germany to recover aid to Sket.</title>
<headline>EU to ask Germany to recover aid to Sket.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Wednesday it had agreed in principle to request Germany to recover 600 million marks in aid it gave bankrupt machinery firm Sket.</p>
</text>
